A re[Eb]minder of [Bb/D]God’s mighty [Cm]judgment
[Ab]As he struck Midian at [Bb]the rock of O[Eb]reb
Deliverance [Bb/D]for the people of the [Cm]Lord
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Ab]Fuel for [Bb]the fire of their destruc[Eb][Bb/D][Cm]tion
